<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Welcome! <STYLE ID="1">Miss April Sickness</STYLE>!" [TN: A pun on gogatsu-byo, 'May sickness,' Japan's term for the May blues.]<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had probably only just been seen off. In the entryway, already standing there, was </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Really, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, don't drag me back to reality."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ahaha, sorry, sorry! But you seem to be in pretty good shape today."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, I'm feeling great today!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Sit wherever, I'll make tea now. It's supposedly luxury stuff from la France."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh, hospitality, huh. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And this is from me, a care package!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Let's see, let's see, chocolate and sakiika. 
{PAUSE ""}
I see... With fancy tea, sakiika is the obvious pick, right―
{PAUSE ""}
Like that makes any sense!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's one dead-straight play-along retort...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\DVD.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "C" "600" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Also, look! A DVD!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh! Isn't this the one we went to see together last year? You bought it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. Apparently the DVD has lots of the parts that got cut from the theater version."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oho, well, well. It has been a long time since I last had the pleasure."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> bowed deeply to the DVD.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Today </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> was awfully high-energy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But I know this is </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> being considerate.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In this season, my mood tends to sink.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So that I can feel even a little happier, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> treats me to a hospitality that goes beyond the tea.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, can you grab the teacups?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okaaay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\食器を動かす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I took two teacups and set them next to the gas stove, where the kettle sat.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"By the way, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, what did the school-closure notice you got say?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"The email said it was a notice from the police."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Same as my class. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I've always wondered, but isn't this kind of thing usually sent out to the whole school?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, <STYLE ID="2">my mom</STYLE> said something about that. Apparently it's to spread out the points of contact for inquiries."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Spread-out-the-points-of-contact...? What's that?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"If they sent the email to the whole school, we'd all try to ask the sender questions and stuff, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　Then handling it would be a pain, so they send the email class by class and have us contact our homeroom teacher directly, supposedly."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is that... efficient...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Beats me..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Seems like every teacher's email would say something different, though. Is that really okay..."</STYLE><PG>
"If it works out fine this way, isn't that good enough?
{PAUSE ""}
　Oh, right, you asked what the email that came around to my class said."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Mmm, for safety's sake, don't go outside, it said."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"For... safety's sake?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s email had no such wording as </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="・・・・・">for safety's sake</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> in it.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"So that means 'it's dangerous outside,' right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I said that, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">'s hands stopped dead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Yeah... guess it does. So it's not an accident or something, it's an incident after all?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The voice of </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, so upbeat until then, dropped an octave.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"And the danger is still out there, which means..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">My own voice naturally dropped too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Terrorism or something? Like poison gas getting <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ま">spread</STYLE> around."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"In a little town of only 40,000 people? Even then, they'd surely put out an evacuation order or something... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe a wanted criminal is hiding out here?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Then maybe they'd take a hostage to get away?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The fun mood from a moment ago was growing subtly stiff.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Sorry, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, just in case, check that the front door's locked."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家ドア閉.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I went to the entryway, checked that it was locked, and then, to be safe, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\カチカチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">put the chain on too.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It was fine. The locks are all set."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Thanks! <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, did you lock up properly when you left your place?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, our place is fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> picked up the hot kettle and poured the water into the teapot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">How can I put it, the atmosphere was strange.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Earlier, when I went out with the trash, I had sensed a slightly tense air too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In this town, what was happening―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Here! Carry the tea over for me, please!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> spoke in a cheerful voice, as if trying to break the stiff air.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\食器を動かす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">I set the tea on the living room table and sat down on the sofa.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\DVD.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "C" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Okay, let's watch it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> had my DVD in her hand before I knew it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">There was a laptop next to the TV, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\DVDドライブへ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">and the DVD went into its disc drive.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was set up to show the picture from the computer on the TV.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="3">'s house is where, whenever we watch DVDs or surf the internet, we always use the computer on the big screen like this.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I looked at the clock: 8:30 a.m.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Normally, this was when I would be getting to school.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, once she had finished setting everything up, sank deep into the sofa and snuggled right up against me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\映画.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\映画.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">While we watched the DVD, we didn't talk at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It wasn't that today's strange air had swallowed us. We were simply absorbed in the DVD.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Though </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> was sucking on sakiika the whole time...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―3 hours later, the end credits on the screen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Right to the very end, both of us had been able to immerse ourselves in the world of the DVD.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ahh, that was fun! It really is the best!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Seeing the parts that got cut, it finally feels like everything adds up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I know, I know! Why'd they cut them from the movie?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Still, the girl who was the main character really was cute."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ha! Right?!
{PAUSE ""}
　'Be reborn as a pure devil! Devil Justice!'"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">With that, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3"> imitated the heroine and snapped into a pose.</STYLE><PG>
